WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:04.546
The Yale veteran
community is truly amazing.

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:07.549
And I think that's because
the administration here makes it

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.801
feel like veterans
really belong at Yale.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.264
Hi, my name is Mikaela Cardillo.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:17.267
I'm a third year student at
Yale Law School.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.770
I served five years in the Navy
as a surface warfare officer.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:24.232
I went to the Naval Academy
right out of high school.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:28.653
I wanted to do something
that was greater than myself

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.989
but then also sort of
see the world

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.907
outside of my hometown
in Indiana.

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:37.203
Veterans Day is
a time to reflect

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:42.250
on the sacrifice that veterans
have made for this country.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:45.837
We all took an oath to defend
American ideals,

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:47.589
and we all took that
with an understanding

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:50.800
that we could possibly
give our lives for those ideals.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.885
People are grateful.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.678
Your country is grateful
for your service

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:55.221
and the sacrifices that you made

